234 cells: d in {8,32,128} x N in {64,256,1024} x four kinds of evaluation point.
(d=512 still training; will extend.) Metric throughout is score MSE divided by
the better of the two single estimators -- so <1 is a win over an ORACLE that
already gets to pick the best of teacher-alone or data-alone.

