HONEST AGGREGATE, so this does not get over-claimed downstream: the headline
0.51x is the BEST noise bucket. Averaged over the whole noise schedule the
shipped rule gives ~6-9% score-MSE reduction. Whether a 6-9% mean score-MSE
improvement moves sample quality at all is a completely separate question, and it
is the one exp06 (end-to-end distillation with exact mode-coverage measurement)
is queued to answer. Until that lands, Track A is a well-measured estimator
result and NOT a demonstrated distillation improvement.

